{"3668330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ShatterRush", "steam_appid": 3668330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/b9ce1d5ea065a20fcdbee151d7ea1884.poster.avif?t=1786865310\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/b9ce1d5ea065a20fcdbee151d7ea1884.webm?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/b9ce1d5ea065a20fcdbee151d7ea1884.mp4?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on any wall. Grapple rooftops. Call in your mech, then blow the map to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ShatterRush is a multiplayer parkour FPS where fluid movement meets massive mechs in fully destructible levels to create flow-state combat you’ve been waiting years for!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/2fb0c4b916431c7027722bfca4bee8e8.poster.avif?t=1786865310\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/2fb0c4b916431c7027722bfca4bee8e8.webm?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/2fb0c4b916431c7027722bfca4bee8e8.mp4?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ShatterRush is a high-speed parkour FPS with massive battle mechs and fully destructible arenas. Master momentum to outplay rivals in 16-player combat where the battlefield reshapes every fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Movement, Instantly Familiar: </strong>Feel the rush as you wall-run, slide, double jump, mantle, dash, stim and grapple with a movement system that is incredibly easy to learn, yet feels right at home with other games you've played before.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Permament Cover: </strong>Blast through walls, floors, and rooftops to create new sightlines, escape routes, and flanks. Nearly every single building in the map can be levelled - adapt or be left in the rubble.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech Mayhem: </strong>Deploy a towering war-machine and literally level the playing field with overpowered weaponry that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/f7a997cbe445a744238da216849cb5a0.poster.avif?t=1786865310\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/f7a997cbe445a744238da216849cb5a0.webm?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/f7a997cbe445a744238da216849cb5a0.mp4?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of ShatterRush's best features, like advanced Source-style movement, playable mechs, and splitscreen have all been implemented directly based off feedback from the community. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that by developing in lock-step with our community, we can truly deliver the movement shooter you've been waiting years for. Our Open Pre-Alpha is available right now for this very reason - so you can be part of the community that shapes this game's future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/eb7aaca660dce07b057e78099bb7f2b0.poster.avif?t=1786865310\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/eb7aaca660dce07b057e78099bb7f2b0.webm?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/eb7aaca660dce07b057e78099bb7f2b0.mp4?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love the movement-shooter space, and we are designing ShatterRush to be the stim-shot this genre needs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible For All:</strong> ShatterRush is designed to be fun at all skill levels, on a variety of hardware setups. Expect incredible high-skill depth for pro players, and fun chaotic action for new players, with performant gameplay that runs well on most modern hardware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-Screen Multiplayer:</strong> Bringing back the glory days of couch gaming, ShatterRush already includes full split-screen support, even when playing global online multiplayer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular, Community-Driven Updates:</strong> We release major updates to our Open Pre-Alpha every 2-3 weeks based on feedback from our players. Be part of the change!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to feel the Rush?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download our Open Pre-Alpha for free, and wishlist now!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/b9ce1d5ea065a20fcdbee151d7ea1884.poster.avif?t=1786865310\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/b9ce1d5ea065a20fcdbee151d7ea1884.webm?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/b9ce1d5ea065a20fcdbee151d7ea1884.mp4?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on any wall. Grapple rooftops. Call in your mech, then blow the map to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ShatterRush is a multiplayer parkour FPS where fluid movement meets massive mechs in fully destructible levels to create flow-state combat you’ve been waiting years for!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/2fb0c4b916431c7027722bfca4bee8e8.poster.avif?t=1786865310\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/2fb0c4b916431c7027722bfca4bee8e8.webm?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/2fb0c4b916431c7027722bfca4bee8e8.mp4?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ShatterRush is a high-speed parkour FPS with massive battle mechs and fully destructible arenas. Master momentum to outplay rivals in 16-player combat where the battlefield reshapes every fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Movement, Instantly Familiar: </strong>Feel the rush as you wall-run, slide, double jump, mantle, dash, stim and grapple with a movement system that is incredibly easy to learn, yet feels right at home with other games you've played before.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Permament Cover: </strong>Blast through walls, floors, and rooftops to create new sightlines, escape routes, and flanks. Nearly every single building in the map can be levelled - adapt or be left in the rubble.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech Mayhem: </strong>Deploy a towering war-machine and literally level the playing field with overpowered weaponry that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/f7a997cbe445a744238da216849cb5a0.poster.avif?t=1786865310\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/f7a997cbe445a744238da216849cb5a0.webm?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/f7a997cbe445a744238da216849cb5a0.mp4?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of ShatterRush's best features, like advanced Source-style movement, playable mechs, and splitscreen have all been implemented directly based off feedback from the community. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that by developing in lock-step with our community, we can truly deliver the movement shooter you've been waiting years for. Our Open Pre-Alpha is available right now for this very reason - so you can be part of the community that shapes this game's future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/eb7aaca660dce07b057e78099bb7f2b0.poster.avif?t=1786865310\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/eb7aaca660dce07b057e78099bb7f2b0.webm?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/extras/eb7aaca660dce07b057e78099bb7f2b0.mp4?t=1786865310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love the movement-shooter space, and we are designing ShatterRush to be the stim-shot this genre needs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible For All:</strong> ShatterRush is designed to be fun at all skill levels, on a variety of hardware setups. Expect incredible high-skill depth for pro players, and fun chaotic action for new players, with performant gameplay that runs well on most modern hardware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-Screen Multiplayer:</strong> Bringing back the glory days of couch gaming, ShatterRush already includes full split-screen support, even when playing global online multiplayer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular, Community-Driven Updates:</strong> We release major updates to our Open Pre-Alpha every 2-3 weeks based on feedback from our players. Be part of the change!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to feel the Rush?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download our Open Pre-Alpha for free, and wishlist now!</strong></p>", "short_description": "ShatterRush is a multiplayer parkour FPS where fluid movement meets massive mechs in fully destructible levels. Wallrun, grapple, and smash through cover to outplay your foes in kinetic, high-speed combat as the map changes with every fight. Join the rush in our free Open Pre-Alpha &amp; wishlist now!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Titanfall meets The Finals in this stunning gameplay demo...  Fans are loving the concept.”<br>Creative Bloq<br><br>“Completely smok[es] these AAA developers…”<br>PapaStanimus<br><br>“Even in 'pre-pre-pre alpha', it's one of the most fun shooters in years.”<br>PCGamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/aef534c6c59a2e44689eca331579561ae12a2f23/header.jpg?t=1786865310", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/ab849e343fa6584885f18778adf69525010598dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786865310", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668330/ab849e343fa6584885f18778adf69525010598dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786865310", "website": "https://www.tetrastudios.com.au/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3-3225 3.3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000; AMD Radeon Vega 8<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-7300U 3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\